A park bench is at $A(-4, 2)$ and a fountain at $B(2, 4)$. Find the midpoint $M$ of the interval $AB$.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.55]
\draw[step=1,gray!25,very thin] (-5,-5) grid (5,5);
\draw[<->] (-5.5,0)--(5.5,0) node[right]{$x$};
\draw[<->] (0,-5.5)--(0,5.5) node[above]{$y$};
\foreach \i in {-5,-4,-3,-2,-1,1,2,3,4,5} \node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\i,0){$\i$};
\foreach \i in {-5,-4,-3,-2,-1,1,2,3,4,5} \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (0,\i){$\i$};
\draw[thick,blue] (-4,2)--(2,4);
\fill (-4,2) circle (2.5pt);
\node[below left,fill=white,inner sep=1pt,font=\scriptsize] at (-4,2){$A(-4,2)$};
\fill (2,4) circle (2.5pt);
\node[above right,fill=white,inner sep=1pt,font=\scriptsize] at (2,4){$B(2,4)$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

